Scope of this license

The MIT License above covers Hookshot's own code. It does not cover these
folders, which keep their own licenses:

  gpu/vk/eden/          Eden's shader recompiler, GPL-3.0-or-later
  gpu/vk/compat/        Eden and yuzu support code, GPL-3.0-or-later
  gpu/vk/sirit/         Sirit, under the license in its folder
  gpu/third_party/      suyu, GPL-2.0-or-later or GPL-3.0-or-later
  third_party/          a64-kit, Opus, SDL and zbic, as listed in each folder

A compiled game links the GPL parts above, so a build as a whole is covered by
the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.

Some files in host/ follow designs from MIT-licensed projects, whose notices are
in third_party/a64-kit/NOTICE.TOTKPort.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Tools bundled in this folder

These are other people's work, shipped unchanged, each under its own license:

  tools/python/         Python, PSF License, with lz4, numpy, capstone, unicorn
                        and zstandard, each under the license in its folder
  tools/emsdk/          LLVM and Clang, Apache-2.0 with LLVM exception
  tools/wgpu-native/    wgpu-native, MIT or Apache-2.0, see its LICENSE.md
  tools/cpm/ffmpeg/     FFmpeg libraries and headers, LGPL-2.1-or-later (parts
                        GPL-2.0-or-later). Source: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html
  tools/cpm/            Vulkan Headers and SPIRV-Headers (Apache-2.0 or MIT),
                        Vulkan Memory Allocator (MIT)
